/assets/

# store signing credentials - must live outside this repo (see
# docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-23-capacitor-store-rollout-design.md Part B); losing the Android
# keystore blocks all future updates to the Play Store listing, and either file leaking is a real
# credential exposure, not just an inconvenience
*.keystore
*.jks
google-services.json
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
